                  {
                    "value": "RELEASE CHECK: the embedded private visual is assembled from the actual release PBIVIZ. sample-validation.json records archive and per-resource SHA-256 equality. This source project is not a PBIX and is not evidence of Microsoft certification.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
